{
  "map": "UndeadRE03a",
  "title": "War of the Damned",
  "locale": "zhTW",
  "note": "Blizzard's order from conversation.json (trigger groups as listed, lines by conversationOrder).",
  "lines": [
    {
      "speaker": "希瓦娜斯",
      "text": "安雅！班達倫隊長！過來這邊！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1694,
        "speaker_string_id": 1695,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C010-010-SYLVANAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "希瓦娜斯女士，那到底是什麼鬼東西？！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1696,
        "speaker_string_id": 1697,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C010-020-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "希瓦娜斯",
      "text": "納克薩瑪斯。這座古老亡城被重新改造為飛行堡壘，是大巫妖科爾蘇加德的家園。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1698,
        "speaker_string_id": 1699,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C010-030-SYLVANAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "希瓦娜斯",
      "text": "它具有強大的破壞力，但將城市廢墟夷為平地並非天譴軍團的目標。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1700,
        "speaker_string_id": 1701,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C010-040-SYLVANAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "希瓦娜斯",
      "text": "那次轟炸突破了地表，製造出通往幽暗城的入口。他們意圖入侵並從被遺忘者手中奪回此地。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1702,
        "speaker_string_id": 1703,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C010-050-SYLVANAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "希瓦娜斯",
      "text": "我能擋住空中的攻勢，但他們的地面大軍已經上路了。我們的前線防禦撐不了太久。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1704,
        "speaker_string_id": 1705,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C010-060-SYLVANAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "我們會用任何能集結到的勢力來強化防線的。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1706,
        "speaker_string_id": 1707,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C010-070-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "安雅",
      "text": "黑暗女王，我保證天譴軍團絕不會抵達幽暗城。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1708,
        "speaker_string_id": 1709,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C010-080-ANYA"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "希瓦娜斯",
      "text": "很好。快行動吧。被遺忘者的命運就掌握在你們手中了。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1710,
        "speaker_string_id": 1711,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C010-090-SYLVANAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "希瓦娜斯",
      "text": "萊尼德，你來得正是時候。真是出乎意料。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1712,
        "speaker_string_id": 1713,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C020-010-SYLVANAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "萊尼德",
      "text": "我們看到納克薩瑪斯前往幽暗城時，就猜到天譴軍團的意圖了。絕不能讓它繼續浮在空中。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1714,
        "speaker_string_id": 1715,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C020-020-LEONID"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "萊尼德",
      "text": "天譴軍團用天空接駁船來部署兵力。如果我們能搶來其中一艘，就能駕駛它抵達亡城。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1716,
        "speaker_string_id": 1717,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C020-030-LEONID"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "天空接駁船一次只載得了我們少數幾個人。我們登上納克薩瑪斯時，究竟要如何摧毀它？",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1718,
        "speaker_string_id": 1719,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C020-040-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "貝恩德",
      "text": "我應該能幫上忙。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1720,
        "speaker_string_id": 1721,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C020-050-BERND"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "貝恩德",
      "text": "這些是我發配給爆破人員的炸藥。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1722,
        "speaker_string_id": 1723,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C020-060-BERND"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "貝恩德",
      "text": "只要在關鍵結構處引爆炸藥，那座傷眼的東西就會自己解體了。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1724,
        "speaker_string_id": 1725,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C020-070-BERND"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "我的朋友，看來你救了我們所有人。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1726,
        "speaker_string_id": 1727,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C020-080-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "貝恩德",
      "text": "我只是回報恩情罷了。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1728,
        "speaker_string_id": 1729,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C020-090-BERND"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "希瓦娜斯",
      "text": "那我們的行動步驟很清楚了。加瑞克，摧毀納克薩瑪斯的任務就交給你。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1730,
        "speaker_string_id": 1731,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C020-100-SYLVANAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "希瓦娜斯",
      "text": "我們這支奇特聯盟的其他人會防守幽暗城，直到你回來為止。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1732,
        "speaker_string_id": 1733,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C020-110-SYLVANAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "黑暗女王，請交給我們。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1734,
        "speaker_string_id": 1735,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C020-120-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "希瓦娜斯",
      "text": "盡可能集結勢力。戰場各處可能還有其他部隊需要你的協助。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1753,
        "speaker_string_id": 1736,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T010-SYLVANAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "安雅",
      "text": "要是納克薩瑪斯再次向我們開火的話，就算阻止地面突襲也沒用。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1754,
        "speaker_string_id": 1737,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T020-ANYA"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "那我們得想辦法把它擊落了。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1755,
        "speaker_string_id": 1738,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T030-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "亡靈守衛",
      "text": "班達倫隊長！我們在其他兩座橋堅守陣地，但恐怕撐不了多久！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1758,
        "speaker_string_id": 1757,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T040-DEATHGUARD"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "我們會視情況所需部署額外部隊。繼續撐下去，直到我們不得不撤退為止！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1756,
        "speaker_string_id": 1739,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T050-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "這些血屍戰車在高地上。我們的工人可以修復它們，強化防禦陣線。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1760,
        "speaker_string_id": 1759,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T090-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "死亡騎士",
      "text": "恐懼會統治一切！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1402,
        "speaker_string_id": 1403,
        "dialogue_id": "DeathKnightWarcry1"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "巫妖",
      "text": "接受死亡！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1404,
        "speaker_string_id": 1405,
        "dialogue_id": "HeroLichYesAttack1"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "地穴領主",
      "text": "天譴軍團會吞噬一切！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1621,
        "speaker_string_id": 1622,
        "dialogue_id": "NerubianCryptLordPissed1"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "瓦里瑪薩斯",
      "text": "這座橋失守了！趕緊撤退，我來掩護你們！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1761,
        "speaker_string_id": 1740,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T100-VARIMATHRAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "瓦里瑪薩斯",
      "text": "我們這裡守不住了！回去幽暗城！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1762,
        "speaker_string_id": 1741,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T110-VARIMATHRAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "瓦里瑪薩斯",
      "text": "敵人太多了！趁還來得及趕緊撤退！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1763,
        "speaker_string_id": 1742,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T120-VARIMATHRAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "它們到底有多少人？！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1764,
        "speaker_string_id": 1743,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T130-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "希瓦娜斯",
      "text": "堅守陣地！一旦我們在此退縮，被遺忘者就輸了！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1765,
        "speaker_string_id": 1744,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T140-SYLVANAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "萊尼德",
      "text": "銀色黎明的騎士！擊潰這些天譴軍團異教徒！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1768,
        "speaker_string_id": 1767,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T150-LEONID"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "是萊尼德！銀色黎明加入戰局了！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1766,
        "speaker_string_id": 1745,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T160-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "我們守住廢墟了！在幽暗城的入口集結！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1769,
        "speaker_string_id": 1746,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T170-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "萊尼德",
      "text": "我會與你並肩作戰，一同進攻納克薩瑪斯。我或許知道用炸藥攻擊哪些地方能造成最大傷害。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1770,
        "speaker_string_id": 1771,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T180-LEONID"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "萊尼德，你怎麼會知道炸藥要放在哪裡？",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1774,
        "speaker_string_id": 1747,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T190-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "萊尼德",
      "text": "在我作為天譴軍團的一員時…曾遊走過納克薩瑪斯的廳堂。我還記得自己在其中所見的一切事物。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1772,
        "speaker_string_id": 1773,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T200-LEONID"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "安雅",
      "text": "那你當時肯定在斯坦索姆。在被北裂境的冰封荒原撕裂後，它就落腳於此地。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1775,
        "speaker_string_id": 1748,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T210-ANYA"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "斯坦索姆…為什麼我…",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1776,
        "speaker_string_id": 1749,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T220-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "不。現在這無關緊要。執行任務最重要。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1777,
        "speaker_string_id": 1750,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T230-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "我們得趕緊抵達天空接駁船，不然會被大軍擊潰的！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1778,
        "speaker_string_id": 1751,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T240-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "死靈法師莫卡斯",
      "text": "入侵者！你們這些叛徒將屈服於天譴軍團！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1779,
        "speaker_string_id": 1780,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T250-NECROMANCERMORKATH"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "快，趁對方援軍還沒抵達，快到天空接駁船去！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1781,
        "speaker_string_id": 1752,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T260-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "亡靈守衛",
      "text": "班達倫隊長，感謝你加入這場戰鬥！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1785,
        "speaker_string_id": 1782,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T060-DEATHGUARD"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "亡靈守衛",
      "text": "這些天譴軍團蛆蟲會後悔攻擊我們的家園的！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1786,
        "speaker_string_id": 1783,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T070-DEATHGUARD"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "憎惡怪",
      "text": "我們怎麼辦？",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1286,
        "speaker_string_id": 1287,
        "dialogue_id": "AbominationWhat1"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "亡靈守衛",
      "text": "呵。被遺忘者才沒那麼容易倒下！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1787,
        "speaker_string_id": 1784,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T080-DEATHGUARD"
      }
    }
  ]
}